<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian security forces stopped a Hezbollah-linked cell that planned to bomb the Homs oil refinery, accusing Hezbollah of the plot. Israeli airstrikes hit southern Syria, causing civilian casualties. Saudi and Syrian leaders met and warned that renewed military escalation could threaten global security and the economy, while the Syrian foreign minister said Damascus is weighing joining the Mecca Pact. The conflict still produces high fatalities, with 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPM0g0RjV4R2R1NGp2RFV1TlRBVzZBdFdiMzlub0VOakZoMnNtX3FES0U0X2p3eVhORHdpR2ZBQm1pUkxWeTlpMzRuVEhibnY0ZWMyRkVmcE5xSUxHT2ZzbXRWOGVZaS10bF9vMU82aWw5SUhkMWR6ejFXVHhKQ0ZNczlSWENYQUFUbnp0LUlqcW1HSjFQZHhWZDNkeDZhb1c2alZ3Smt2TDJWT2hEVlJv?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Syrian Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxQZk8zcFI3ZUtEOTczT0lJYTFORHp5OTVObnJfdHN1ODk5Ymo4YlJ1eV9wSFg4UkxSWGY0ejl6ZmREb2cxMEMzVHQwSHc5TE1SaWZBUUVwX2ZiYXRNSGxKQjdFZzRHYnRwTXFuTjdLa05xbDN4WWJCYlNEcFBkV1VBY0JBQ1RxQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Syria Direct&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPR0k4VHp0Ml9YQjAyUnFuTXppdHdFOHJfanlNTlk0V01XdWtkWVRsdmFNTXNvWWRuaEtwR0lJaDJYaFFsU19UWGQzeDZpaEZOV1VjOFNlWnNzNFlKUHEtc2FJMW43dDNHVlpFNU1KaE43TEtyenJJZEVXd1JBemxrTU1UNEZNQ3dhYkFTNWVibk9EdmJ6WDZMeU8tUDAzMklpRWtF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Enab Baladi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Enab Baladi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&q